From: Steven Batchelor <srbatchelor@ovgl.org>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:51:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Bind VBS guest reports only to current-boot successful guest
 writes

---
 .../tpm/tpm_device/src/guest_report_input.rs  | 99 +++++++++++++++++++
 vm/devices/tpm/tpm_device/src/lib.rs          | 38 ++++---
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
